<title>UK: EIB adds 100 million marks to December 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 100 million marks to December 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 500 million marks from 400 million marks, joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and SC Warburg said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50 PCT  MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.315   PAY DATE  **29.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED 15.JAN.97, INCREASED 05.FEB.97</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 37 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE ONE DAY AFTER PAYMENT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
